    "text": "my friend barnet, with heart so true,  \na smile that lights the darkest dusk.  \nyou speak with grace, with kindness deep,  \nand always there, when life feels slow.  \n\nyour laughter rings like summer's song,  \na melody that never fades.  \nyou carry dreams, with courage and care,  \nand share them with the world around.  \n\nbarnet, you're a light in every room,  \na friend who knows your soul's true name.  \nwith every step you take, you're strong,  \nand in your heart, a fire is born.  \n\nso here's to you, my friend barnet,  \na beacon in the night, so bright.  \nmay your journey be filled with grace,  \nand may your heart always be wide.",
